  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "畢業專題",
    "sub_ename": "GRADUATION PROJECT",
    "describe_ch": "大學期間所學習的知識與創作技能，應用在文學、文化、學術與文教等各類專題領域的學習。以動態或靜態方式，展現本課程實施之成果。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed to guide students integrating major learning, general education courses, service learning, club activities, and work experience to show the learning outcomes of the study period. According to the students' expertise interest, the course is divided into four major items including academic research, the performing arts, literature and art creation, and editing and publishing. In addition to the basis of lectures, the relevant expertise of the department teachers will be requested as a group or individual guidance. At the end of the period, students present the learning outcomes with the thesis published, performances and publication.",
